    "text_delta": "egarding the Head of Risk Modelling role. As I continue to target senior leadership opportunities, any insights on how I can better align my profile with organizational priorities would be greatly appreciated.\"*\n\n2. **Frame Feedback Around Strategic Gaps:**\n   If you receive feedback or secure a brief call, ask targeted questions:\n   * *Were there specific regulatory, managerial, or governance experiences they felt were missing from your profile?*\n   * *What strategic priorities tipped the balance toward the selected candidate?*\n\n3. **Protect Your Professional Standing:**\n   Risk modelling at senior levels is a relatively small community. Focusing on constructive takeaways and maintaining positive relations with the panel will serve your career far better than pursuing an unsubstantiated grievance.\n",
